<title>FRANCE: CCF says bank's rating to be upgraded.</title>
<headline>CCF says bank's rating to be upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Commercial de France (CCF) chairman Charles de Croisset said on Thursday that the debt rating of the French bank was about to be upgraded.</p>
<p>&quot;The CCF is a very solid bank whose rating is in the process of being uprgraded,&quot; he told an investment seminar.</p>
<p>The bank is currently graded AA3 by Moody's rating agency.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 pmc</p>
</text>
